body:
Hi @lionel218, thanks for opening this issue. InstantSearch.js does not provide event listener per widget. But you can listen to changes of the search state using:

```js
const search = instantsearch(yourConfig);
search.start();
search.helper.on('change', (state) => {
  // here you can see the values of the search parameters
})
```

If you give us the use case, we might be able to give your a more specific answer.
